# Symbols -- cmap for Symbols.png (see docs/framebuf/bmfont.md)
# Symbols are reached by ASCII codes, with Unicode codepoints following (wuss
# draws U+2713 for its menu tick, U+25B6 for its submenu arrow and U+21E7
# for Shift in menu shortcuts). Blank cells are left unmapped. Cells 17-20
# (window pictograms) and 29 have no obvious codepoint so stay ASCII-only.
U+0020..U+0027  0
U+002A          10
U+002C..U+002E  12
U+0031..U+0034  17
U+0036          22
U+003C..U+003E  28
U+21E7          8     # upwards white arrow (Shift, in menu shortcuts)
U+2336          22    # APL I-beam (text cursor)
U+25A0          1     # black square
U+25B6          30    # black right-pointing triangle
U+25C0          28    # black left-pointing triangle
U+25C6          0     # black diamond
U+25C9          5     # fisheye (radio button on)
U+25CB          4     # white circle (radio button off)
U+25CF          2     # black circle
U+2610          6     # ballot box
U+2611          7     # ballot box with check
U+2713          10    # check mark
U+274F          3     # lower right drop-shadowed white square
U+1F4A3         12    # bomb
U+1F4BE         14    # floppy disk
U+1F5CE         13    # document
